{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "en",
  "language_raw": "English",
  "source": "message/dat/English/script/s1_side02_0035.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/English/script/s1_side02_0035.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s1_side02_0035_camera_01",
      "hash64": "32EDDF8013904700",
      "text": "She may be old, but she’s still a fine tent, eh![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s1_side02_0035_camera_02",
      "hash64": "32EDE28013904C19",
      "text": "It’s actually my dad’s, but he wasn’t using it, so I\\njust helped myself to it.[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s1_side02_0035_camera_03",
      "hash64": "32EDE18013904A66",
      "text": "Say hello to our new base of operations for our\\nsurvey of the Bloodmoon Beast![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s1_side02_0035_dog_01",
      "hash64": "D95290E2CA22E04D",
      "text": "Wow-ow!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s1_side02_0035_camera_04",
      "hash64": "32EDE48013904F7F",
      "text": "Now, the Bloodmoon Beast is way more wary\\nthan an ordinary Pokémon.[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s1_side02_0035_camera_05",
      "hash64": "32EDE38013904DCC",
      "text": "That’s why there have been so few sightings—or\\nso they say.[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s1_side02_0035_camera_06",
      "hash64": "32EDE680139052E5",
      "text": "That means we’re going to need to do some slow\\nand steady groundwork if we wanna find it![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s1_side02_0035_camera_07",
      "hash64": "32EDE58013905132",
      "text": "So, partner, what I’m going to need your help\\nwith most...is [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]photographing Pokémon[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s1_side02_0035_camera_08",
      "hash64": "32EDE8801390564B",
      "text": "I want you to take photos of the Pokémon that\\nappear around here on foggy nights.[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s1_side02_0035_camera_09",
      "hash64": "32EDE78013905498",
      "text": "I’m looking for lots of pictures of a good variety\\nof Pokémon![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s1_side02_0035_camera_10",
      "hash64": "32EA7A80138D658A",
      "text": "Afterward, I’ll register your photo data into my\\nhandy Pokémon Searcher![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s1_side02_0035_camera_11",
      "hash64": "32EA7B80138D673D",
      "text": "Over time, that’ll train it to ignore any sign of\\nother Pokémon that live around here.\\c\\nClearing all that noise will let us pinpoint\\nexactly where the Bloodmoon Beast is![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 172,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s1_side02_0035_select_01",
      "hash64": "66DDCC2DC348E231",
      "text": "Brilliant!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s1_side02_0035_select_02",
      "hash64": "66DDC92DC348DD18",
      "text": "I don’t get it!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s1_side02_0035_camera_12",
      "hash64": "32EA7880138D6224",
      "text": "Whoa, you actually understood that?![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s1_side02_0035_camera_13",
      "hash64": "32EA7980138D63D7",
      "text": "I was just rattling off what the manual said.\\c\\nI picked this thing up at a thrift shop. I don’t\\nreally understand how it’s supposed to work.[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 142,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s1_side02_0035_camera_14",
      "hash64": "32EA7680138D5EBE",
      "text": "Right! Who would![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s1_side02_0035_camera_15",
      "hash64": "32EA7780138D6071",
      "text": "To be honest, I’ve got no idea how it’s supposed\\nto work either.\\c\\nI just picked this thing up at a thrift shop, and\\nthat’s what it says to do in the manual.\\c\\nI’m sure it’ll be fine, right?[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 158,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 192,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s1_side02_0035_camera_16",
      "hash64": "32EA7480138D5B58",
      "text": "My preliminary surveys make me think there are\\nactually dozens of Pokémon species that tend to\\r\\nshow up around the forest on foggy nights.[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 140,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s1_side02_0035_camera_17",
      "hash64": "32EA7580138D5D0B",
      "text": "We can split the load, so how about you try and\\nsnap photos of [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]10 species [VAR 0xFF00(0000)]of Pokémon for me?[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s1_side02_0035_camera_18",
      "hash64": "32EA7280138D57F2",
      "text": "How ’bout it, partner? If we tackle this together,\\nI’m sure we’ll find the Bloodmoon Beast![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s1_side02_0035_camera_19",
      "hash64": "32EA7380138D59A5",
      "text": "Oh, and we’re looking for clear photos that get\\nthe Pokémon nice and big in the frame!\\c\\nYou’ll want to sneak up on foot to get close to\\nthem—no riding on big, noisy Pokémon![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 175,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s1_side02_0035_camera_20",
      "hash64": "32E77480138B2581",
      "text": "Think you’re ready? Just say the word!\\c\\nOnce you’re good, we can set up in the tent\\nand wait for a [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]foggy night[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 101,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 116,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 121,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
